; MRT_ZTAIL's second differences (SPEC.md 105.6.1). In mrt_unz's order:
; a byte table's last entry spills its high byte onto the next table's
; first, which that table's own expansion then writes
%if MR_BSS & 1
%assign MR_BSS MR_BSS + 1
%endif
